// Rule:        Executables created or launched from C:\Users\Public or ProgramData\Microsoft
// Tactics:     Defense Evasion, Command and Control
// Techniques:  T1036.005, T1105 (Ingress Tool Transfer)
// Source:      Sysmon EventID 11 (file create) and 1 (process creation)
// Seen in:     Q11.2 and Q11.3 - OneDriveSync.exe and wsync.exe dropped by an injected process
// Severity:    Medium
// Tuning:      Allow-list known installers. Weight alerts where the writer is a process that was itself injected.
HarborlightDental_CL
| where EventID == 11
| where TargetFilename endswith ".exe" or TargetFilename endswith ".dll"
| where TargetFilename startswith @"C:\Users\Public\" or TargetFilename startswith @"C:\ProgramData\Microsoft\"
| project EventTime, host, Image, TargetFilename
